{'symbol': 'PEAK', 'date': '2022-05-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'DENVER, MAY 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: PEAK) TODAY ANNOUNCED RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2022. \xa0FIRST QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE AND RECENT HIGHLIGHTS\xa0\xa0\xa0 –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 NET INCOME OF $0.13 PER SHARE, NAREIT FFO OF $0.45 PER SHARE, FFO AS ADJUSTED OF $0.43 PER SHARE, AND BLENDED TOTAL SAME-STORE PORTFOLIO CASH (ADJUSTED) NOI GROWTH OF 5.6% LIFE SCIENCE AND MOB SAME-STORE PORTFOLIO CASH (ADJUSTED) NOI GROWTH OF 5.2% AND 3.6%, RESPECTIVELY TOTAL PRO FORMA SAME-STORE PORTFOLIO CASH (ADJUSTED) NOI GROWTH OF 3.2% EXCLUDING GOVERNMENT GRANTS RECEIVED UNDER THE CARES ACT AT OUR CCRC PROPERTIES\xa0 –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 LIFE SCIENCE DEVELOPMENT: PLACED 263,000 SQUARE FEET OF 100% LEASED CLASS A LIFE SCIENCE DEVELOPMENTS IN SERVICE DURING THE FIRST QUARTER, REPRESENTING $262 MILLION OF TOTAL INVESTMENT\xa0 ACTIVE LIFE SCIENCE DEVELOPMENTS 71% PRE-LEASED AS OF MARCH 31, 2022 WITH SIGNIFICANT ACTIVE TENANT INTEREST IN REMAINING AVAILABILITY\xa0 –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 PLACED IN SERVICE THREE ON-CAMPUS HCA MEDICAL OFFICE DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS REPRESENTING 237,000 SQUARE FEET AND $68 MILLION OF INVESTMENT AT COMPLETION; THE PROPERTIES WERE 61% LEASED AS OF MARCH 31, 2022 –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 ACQUIRED TWO MEDICAL OFFICE BUILDINGS ON THE CAMPUS OF AN HCA HOSPITAL IN THE HOUSTON MSA FOR $43 MILLION –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 NET DEBT TO ADJUSTED EBITDARE AND LIQUIDITY WERE 5.1X AND $2.1 BILLION, RESPECTIVELY, AS OF MARCH 31, 2022 –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 KATHY SANDSTROM APPOINTED INDEPENDENT VICE CHAIR OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE TO BE PAID ON MAY 20, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 9, 2022\xa0 –\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 RECENT ESG ACCOMPLISHMENTS INCLUD